      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-body mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Carb Strategy:</strong> Don't eliminate carbs entirely. Moderate carbs (1.5 to 3.0 g/kg) centered around your training window keep workouts explosive and thyroid hormones (T3) functioning normally.
      </p>
