      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-body mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Carb Strategy:</strong> Once protein is locked in at 1.6 to 2.0 g/kg, allocating remaining surplus calories primarily to complex carbohydrates (4 to 7 g/kg) drives cellular hydration, maximizes glycogen supercompensation, and fuels higher training volume.
      </p>
