  <p>How should you structure your daily macro distribution? Use these evidence-based starting frameworks, which you can easily customize with our <a href="/guides/macro-guide/" class="text-brand underline font-medium">Beginner Macro Guide</a>:</p>

  <div class="not-prose my-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
