      <p class="text-2xl font-black text-brand mt-2">40% P / 25% C / 35% F</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-body mt-2">Prioritizes aggressive hunger suppression, insulin sensitivity, and high thermic burn for non-athletes.</p>
